{"headword":"הֲדַדְעֶ֫זֶר","parent_lexicon":"BDB Dictionary","content":{"senses":[{"definition":"<strong>n.pr.m. Hadadezer (</strong>so Aramaic inscr. <span dir=\"rtl\">הדדעזר</span> Eut<sup>SBAk 1885, 679</sup> cf. Bae<sup>Rel. 67</sup>; 𝔊 throughout (erroneously) Ἁδρα(α)ζαρ;—<em>Hadad is help</em>(<em>er</em>), cf. COT <a data-ref=\"I Kings 20:1\" href=\"/I_Kings.20.1\">1 K 20:1</a> & Ph. <span dir=\"rtl\">אשמנעזר</span><strong>)</strong>; king of <span dir=\"rtl\">צוֹבָה</span> (q.v.), son of <span dir=\"rtl\">רְחֹב</span> defeated by David <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 8:3\" href=\"/II_Samuel.8.3\">2 S 8:3</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 8:5\" href=\"/II_Samuel.8.5\">5</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 8:10\" href=\"/II_Samuel.8.10\">10</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 8:12\" href=\"/II_Samuel.8.12\">12</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">הֲדַדְעָ֑זֶר</span> v <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 8:7\" href=\"/II_Samuel.8.7\">7</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 8:8\" href=\"/II_Samuel.8.8\">8</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 8:9\" href=\"/II_Samuel.8.9\">9</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 8:10\" href=\"/II_Samuel.8.10\">10</a> (= <span dir=\"rtl\">הֲדַרְעֶזֶר</span> q.v. <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 10:16\" href=\"/II_Samuel.10.16\">10:16</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 10:19\" href=\"/II_Samuel.10.19\">19</a> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 18:3\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.18.3\">1 Ch 18:3</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 18:5\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.18.5\">5</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 18:7\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.18.7\">7</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 18:8\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.18.8\">8</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 18:10\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.18.10\">10</a><sup>(×2)</sup>; <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 19:16\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.19.16\">19:16</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 19:19\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.19.19\">19</a>, all erron., v. inscr. supr., = cf. Bae<sup>l.c.</sup> Dr on <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 8:3\" href=\"/II_Samuel.8.3\">2 S 8:3</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 10:16\" href=\"/II_Samuel.10.16\">10:16</a>); also <a data-ref=\"I Kings 11:23\" href=\"/I_Kings.11.23\">1 K 11:23</a>."}]},"rid":"BDB02289","strong_numbers":["1909"],"next_hw":"הֲדַדְרִמּוֹן","prev_hw":"הֲדַד","all_cited":true,"quotes":[],"GK":["2061"],"TWOT":[],"parent_lexicon_details":{"name":"BDB Dictionary","language":"heb.biblical","to_language":"eng","text_categories":[],"source":"BDB Dictionary","attribution":"F. Brown, S. Driver & C. Briggs","index_title":"BDB","version_title":"A Hebrew and English lexicon of the Old Testament, by Francis Brown. With the co-operation of S. R. Driver and Charles A. Briggs. Oxford, 1906","version_lang":"en","should_autocomplete":true}}